### 1. Estilos Avanzados (`/assets/functions/Terminal/TerminalStyles.css`)

Este fichero encapsula todos los estilos visuales con estética retro-futurista CRT, scanlines, efectos de parpadeo y soporte para temas de color (Hacker Green, Cyberpunk Cyan, Amber).

```css
/* =================================================================ato
 * V1R3-SEC-OPS: Terminal Engine Stylesheet
 * Absolute Path: /assets/functions/Terminal/TerminalStyles.css
 * ================================================================= */

:root {
  --term-bg: rgba(10, 14, 20, 0.95);
  --term-border: #00ff66;
  --term-text: #00ff66;
  --term-dim: #008833;
  --term-accent: #ff0055;
  --term-cyan: #00f0ff;
  --term-yellow: #f3e600;
  --term-font: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Courier New', monospace;
}

/* Floating Widget Trigger Button */
#v1r3-soc-trigger {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 24px;
  right: 24px;
  z-index: 9999;
  background: var(--term-bg);
  border: 2px solid var(--term-border);
  color: var(--term-text);
  padding: 10px 16px;
  font-family: var(--term-font);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  cursor: pointer;
  box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.3);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  border-radius: 4px;
  backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
}

#v1r3-soc-trigger:hover {
  background: var(--term-border);
  color: #000;
  box-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--term-border);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

#v1r3-soc-trigger .status-dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  background-color: var(--term-border);
  border-radius: 50%;
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--term-border);
  animation: pulse-dot 1.5s infinite;
}

#v1r3-soc-trigger:hover .status-dot {
  background-color: #000;
  box-shadow: none;
}

@keyframes pulse-dot {
  0% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8; }
  50% { transform: scale(1.25); opacity: 1; box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--term-border); }
  100% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8; }
}

/* Terminal Modal / Overlay Container */
#v1r3-soc-modal {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100vw;
  height: 100vh;
  background: rgba(5, 8, 12, 0.85);
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  z-index: 10000;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity 0.25s ease-in-out;
}

#v1r3-soc-modal.active {
  opacity: 1;
  pointer-events: auto;
}

/* Terminal Window Frame */
